  "question": "A long solenoid of $50$ cm length having $100$ turns carries a current of $2.5$ A. The magnetic field at the centre of the solenoid is : ($\\mu_0 = 4\\pi \\times 10^{-7}\\ \\text{T m A}^{-1}$)",
