  "solution": "Turns per unit length: $n = \\dfrac{100}{0.5} = 200\\ \\text{m}^{-1}$.\n\n$$B = \\mu_0 nI = 4\\pi \\times 10^{-7} \\times 200 \\times 2.5 = 2\\pi \\times 10^{-4} \\approx 6.28 \\times 10^{-4}\\ \\text{T}$$",
